            "review_text": "Gérard G\n6 contributions\n0\nThe Forgotten ones not to be “forgotten”!\nMay 2024 • Family\nOh it's been several times and become common that I go to the Oubliés of Ngoc Thuy Long Well and good, I bring a lot of friends there who are happy about it, we understand why, it's nice, welcoming and welcoming. eat there and even relax with a drink, it's worth the trip.\nFurthermore good, well cooked by a Chef and, and, and not expensive value for money. You can be modest and enjoy it the French way.\nI really encourage anyone to discover The Forgotten by Ngoc Thuy Long Bien\nAh, 12’ from the center of Hanoi \nGerard\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten June 5, 2024",
