            "review_text": "philoviet\n120 contributions\n0\nGreat discovery\nJan 2024 • Couples\nDifficult to find because Grab has not updated the address, so rely on Google map.\nExcellent bistro where we shared a white pudding as a starter followed by a delicious Australian sole meunière washed down with a glass of red wine from Spain and we took away an almond pancake, a real treat, the best in Hanoi without a doubt. Well done Geoffrey.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten January 7, 2024",
