            "review_title": "Review at Les Oubliés",
            "review_text": "Geoffrey\nHanoi, Vietnam8 contributions\n0\nAn address not to be missed\nDec 2023 • Family\nLes Oubliés, “not to forget”, extra French cuisine, tasty, classic for lovers of authenticity, a Chef keen to delight his guests, a daily slate, a tempting menu, in French and Vietnamese, see: beef cheek extra flavored with mulled wine, homemade smoked salmon, sauerkraut, bourguignon, sole meunière (600g!!!), lamb shank, imported beefsteak, salads made with vegetables, seasonal citrus fruits, but also snacks: spaghetti, panini, sandwiches richly garnished, wines and beers, seasonal fruit juices from Vietnam, in short, enough to delight all gourmets at the risk of having to return often or passing through.\nIn short, I liked it, Geoffrey is a Chef we appreciate, assisted by Ly, his charming and smiling wife. A unique bistro-restaurant in Hanoi in its authenticity Ah, one last word, the prices are reasonable for everyone. Enjoy your food. Gérard, a veteran of the French restaurateur profession in Hanoi\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten December 25, 2023",
